This extension adds BioShock Remastered modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]GOG[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs TFC Installer itself to the game folder itself (no subfolder), recognised by a "tfcinstaller.exe" file.[/*]
[*]Installs UPK Explorer itself to the game folder itself (no subfolder), recognised by a "upk explorer.exe" file.[/*]
[*]Installs TFC mod with a "gameprofile.xml" file or a ".packagepatch" file to the "TFCInstaller\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Root Folder mod with a "ContentBaked" folder to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Installs Cooked Sub Folder mod with a ".blk" file to the "ContentBaked\pc\BulkContent" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Movies mod with a ".bik" file to the "ContentBaked\pc\BinkMovies" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Binaries (Engine Injector) mod with a "BioshockHD.exe" file or a ".dll" file to the "Build\Final" folder.[/*]
[*]Any other mod not described above is installed to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

